  "html": "<div class=\"floatleft\"><span><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Algernon4.jpg\" title=\"Algernon4.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"323\" src=\"/images/Algernon4.jpg\" width=\"731\"/></a></span></div><br/>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th><i>Dungeon Levels</i>\n</th><th><i>Layout</i>\n</th><th><i>Mobs</i>\n</th><th><i>Mobs</i>\n</th><th><i>Best Attack to Use</i>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Algernon Level 1-4</b>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Layout\" title=\"Wasteland Layout\">Wasteland</a>\n</td><td>Oroks\n</td><td>Whiskers, Poison Whiskers\n</td><td><b>Fire</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#Orok_Outpost\" title=\"\"><i><b>--Orok Outpost</b></i></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Forest_Layout\" title=\"Forest Layout\">Forest</a>\n</td><td>Oroks\n</td><td>Poison Whiskers\n</td><td><b>Fire</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#Kog.27s_Gearbox\" title=\"\"><i><b>--Kog's Gearbox</b></i></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Forest_Layout\" title=\"Forest Layout\">Forest</a>\n</td><td>Oroks\n</td><td>Poison Whiskers\n</td><td><b>Fire</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#Capwn.27s_Family_Ratstaurant\" title=\"\"><i><b>--Capwn's Family Ratstaurant</b></i></a>\n</td><td>  --\n</td><td>Oroks\n</td><td>Poison Whiskers\n</td><td><b>Fire</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#Not_The_Rumored_Refinery\" title=\"\"><i><b>--Not The Rumored Refinery</b></i></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Forest_Layout\" title=\"Forest Layout\">Forest</a>\n</td><td>Oroks\n</td><td>Whiskers, Poisoned Whiskers\n</td><td><b>Fire</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Algernon Level 5-7</b>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ruined_Castle_Layout\" title=\"Ruined Castle Layout\">Ruined Castle</a>\n</td><td>Oroks\n</td><td>Whiskers, Poison Whiskers\n</td><td><b>Fire</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#Porthole_Laboratory\" title=\"\"><i><b>--Porthole Laboratory</b></i></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Torture_Chamber_Layout\" title=\"Torture Chamber Layout\">Torture Chamber</a>\n</td><td>Fire Mutant\n</td><td>Fire Fade\n</td><td><b>Ice</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#Little_Dew_Valley_Forest\" title=\"\"><i><b>--Little Dew Valley Forest</b></i></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Forest_Layout\" title=\"Forest Layout\">Forest</a>\n</td><td>Fire Mutants\n</td><td>Fire Fades\n</td><td><b>Ice</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#Sissirat.27s_Lair\" title=\"\"><i><b>**Sissirat's Lair</b></i></a>\n</td><td>Special Dungeon\n</td><td>Poison Whiskers\n</td><td> ---\n</td><td><b>Fire</b>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><b>Algernon is recommended for players from Levels 3 to 20.  It is the second dungeon in the usual sequence.  After finishing Dew Valley Forest, players will go to <a href=\"/wiki/Townston\" title=\"Townston\">Townston</a> where they will find the portal leading to Algernon.  Like most dungeons in the game, Algernon consists of 7 levels with several sub dungeons.  As in most dungeons, on Level 5 you will find the portal to the next dungeon, <a href=\"/wiki/Algors_Terror_Dome_Base_Camp\" title=\"Algors Terror Dome Base Camp\">Algors Terror Dome Base Camp</a>.  After the 7 regular levels is the <a href=\"/wiki/Boss\" title=\"Boss\">Boss</a> Lair.  The Boss of Algernon is <a href=\"/wiki/Sissirat\" title=\"Sissirat\">Sissirat</a>.</b>\n</p><p><i><b><big>ALGERNON HAS UNDERGONE A COMPLETE RE-D0 IN VERSION 121!! WE NEED YOUR HELP TO UPDATE THIS PAGE!!</big></b></i><br/>\n<i>So far levels 1-4 and Level 7 have been updated.</i>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"DUNGEON_DETAILS\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>DUNGEON DETAILS</b></span></h1>\n<a name=\"Level_1\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 1</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Layout\" title=\"Wasteland Layout\">Wasteland Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Prospector\" title=\"Whisker Prospector\">Whisker Prospectors</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Flinger\" title=\"Whisker Flinger\">Whisker Flingers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Blademaster\" title=\"Whisker Blademaster\">Whisker Blademasters</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Crooked_Guard\" title=\"Crooked Guard\">Crooked Guards</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wolf\" title=\"Wolf\">Wargs</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wolf_Pup\" title=\"Wolf Pup\">Warg Pups</a>\n</p><p><br/>\n<b>Champion</b> <a href=\"/wiki/Particularly_Rude_Broodling\" title=\"Particularly Rude Broodling\">Particularly Rude Broodling</a>, and the Whisker Miner, who carries the Mining Pick that is needed to mine Fizz Rocks.\n</p><p><b>NPC's:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Aloufe_-_Sir_Queueotus_of_Drekshin\" title=\"Aloufe - Sir Queueotus of Drekshin\">Aloufe - Sir Queueotus of Drekshin</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Soldier_Hogarth\" title=\"Soldier Hogarth\">Soldier Hogarth</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Sir_Kent_the_Artisan\" title=\"Sir Kent the Artisan\">Sir Kent the Artisan</a>. To get the gate open where <a href=\"/wiki/Sir_Kent_the_Artisan\" title=\"Sir Kent the Artisan\">Sir Kent the Artisan</a> is located, kill the <a href=\"/wiki/Particularly_Rude_Broodling\" title=\"Particularly Rude Broodling\">Particularly Rude Broodling</a> located someplace in level 1 Algernon.\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Squeakeasy\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Squeakeasy</span></h2>\n<p>After you find the Squeakeasy Password, you can open the gate to the Squeakeasy. The Bouncer is a large <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Mutant Hulk\">Mutant Hulk</a>, and once past him you will encounter <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Blademaster\" title=\"Whisker Blademaster\">Star Fizz-Soaked Blademasters</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker\" title=\"Whisker\">Star Fizz-Soaked Whiskers</a> as well as another <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Mutant Hulk\">Mutant Hulk Server</a>.  Here also you will find the <a href=\"/wiki/Squeakeasy_Bookkeeper\" title=\"Squeakeasy Bookkeeper\">Squeakeasy Bookkeeper</a>, a giant Whisker who is the object of a quest, and the Fizz S.T.I.L.L.\n</p>\n<a name=\"NPC\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\">NPC</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Kurley_the_Lazy\" title=\"Kurley the Lazy\">Kurley the Lazy</a>, a quest giving <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Prospector\" title=\"Whisker Prospector\">Whisker Prospector</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Orok_Outpost\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Orok Outpost</span></h2>\n<p>Located off Algernon level 1. Consists of <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Spawn\" title=\"Orok Spawn\">Orok Hatchlings</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Scout\" title=\"Orok Scout\">Orok Scouts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Mystic\" title=\"Orok Mystic\">Orok Mystics</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warriors</a>. In the later levels there will be <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Juggernauts\" title=\"Orok Juggernauts\">Orok Juggernauts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Blademaster\" title=\"Whisker Blademaster\">Whisker Blademasters</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Shaman\" title=\"Whisker Shaman\">Whisker Shaman</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_2\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 2</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Layout\" title=\"Wasteland Layout\">Wasteland Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Prospector\" title=\"Whisker Prospector\">Whisker Prospectors</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Flinger\" title=\"Whisker Flinger\">Whisker Flingers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Blademaster\" title=\"Whisker Blademaster\">Whisker Blademasters</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Crooked_Guard\" title=\"Crooked Guard\">Crooked Guards</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wolf\" title=\"Wolf\">Wargs</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wolf_Pup\" title=\"Wolf Pup\">Warg Pups</a>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"NPC.27s\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">NPC's</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Sir_Panickee\" title=\"Sir Panickee\">Sir Panickee</a>\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Level_3\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 3</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Layout\" title=\"Wasteland Layout\">Wasteland Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Prospector\" title=\"Whisker Prospector\">Whisker Prospectors</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Flinger\" title=\"Whisker Flinger\">Whisker Flingers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Blademaster\" title=\"Whisker Blademaster\">Whisker Blademasters</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Crooked_Guard\" title=\"Crooked Guard\">Crooked Guards</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wolf\" title=\"Wolf\">Wargs</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wolf_Pup\" title=\"Wolf Pup\">Warg Pups</a>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Capwn.27s_Family_Ratstaurant\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Capwn's Family Ratstaurant</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Crypt_Layout\" title=\"Crypt Layout\">Crypt Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Spawn\" title=\"Orok Spawn\">Orok Spawn</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warriors</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Scout\" title=\"Orok Scout\">Orok Scouts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Blademaster\" title=\"Whisker Blademaster\">Fizz Star-Soaked Blademasters</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Crooked_Guard\" title=\"Crooked Guard\">Crooked Guards</a>, as well as the Hero <a href=\"/wiki/Capwn\" title=\"Capwn\">Capwn</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Kog.27s_Gearbox\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Kog's Gearbox</span></h2>\n<p>Located off Algernon level 3. Consists of <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Spawn\" title=\"Orok Spawn\">Orok Spawn</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Scout\" title=\"Orok Scout\">Orok Scouts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Mystic\" title=\"Orok Mystic\">Orok Mystics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warriors</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Mutant Hulk\">Mutant Hulks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Blademaster\" title=\"Poison Blademaster\">Poison Blademasters</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Broodling\" title=\"Poison Broodling\">Poison Broodlings</a> . In this dungeon, you will also encounter <a href=\"/wiki/Kog_the_Mighty\" title=\"Kog the Mighty\">Kog the Mighty</a>, a hero ranked <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warrior</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_4\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 4</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Dungeon_Layout\" title=\"Dungeon Layout\">Dungeon Layout</a>.  Contains: <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Spawn\" title=\"Orok Spawn\">Orok Spawn</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Scout\" title=\"Orok Scout\">Orok Scouts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Mystic\" title=\"Orok Mystic\">Orok Mystics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warriors</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Mutant Hulk\">Mutant Hulks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Blademaster\" title=\"Poison Blademaster\">Poison Blademasters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Broodling\" title=\"Poison Broodling\">Poison Broodlings</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Venomspitter\" title=\"Whisker Venomspitter\">Whisker Venomspitters</a>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Not_The_Rumored_Refinery\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Not The Rumored Refinery</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Forest_Layout\" title=\"Forest Layout\">Forest Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Blademaster\" title=\"Whisker Blademaster\">Fizz Star-Soaked Blademasters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker\" title=\"Whisker\">Whisker Prospectors</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Flinger\" title=\"Whisker Flinger\">Whisker Flingers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Crooked_Guard\" title=\"Crooked Guard\">Crooked Guards</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wolf\" title=\"Wolf\">Wargs</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wolf\" title=\"Wolf\">Warg Pups</a>.  On this level is the <a href=\"/wiki/Not_The_Rumored_Refinery_Forerat\" title=\"Not The Rumored Refinery Forerat\">Not The Rumored Refinery Forerat</a> who is a quest object.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_5\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 5</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ruined_Castle_Layout\" title=\"Ruined Castle Layout\">Ruined Castle Layout</a>.  Contains: <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Spawn\" title=\"Orok Spawn\">Orok Spawn</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Scout\" title=\"Orok Scout\">Orok Scouts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Mystic\" title=\"Orok Mystic\">Orok Mystics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warriors</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Mutant Hulk\">Mutant Hulks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Blademaster\" title=\"Poison Blademaster\">Poison Blademasters</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Broodling\" title=\"Poison Broodling\">Poison Broodlings</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Venomspitter\" title=\"Whisker Venomspitter\">Whisker Venomspitters</a>\n</p>\n<a name=\"NPC.27s_2\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">NPC's</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Soldier_Germ\" title=\"Soldier Germ\">Soldier Germ</a>\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Tainted_Grove\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Tainted Grove</span></h2>\n<p>Located off Algernon level 5. \n<a href=\"/wiki/Forest_Layout\" title=\"Forest Layout\">Forest Layout</a>. Consists of fire monsters. Includes <a href=\"/wiki/Hell_Hulk\" title=\"Hell Hulk\">Hell Hulks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Fire_Belcher\" title=\"Mutant Fire Belcher\">Mutant Fire Belchers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fade_Fire_Lich\" title=\"Fade Fire Lich\">Fade Fire Lichs</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Pincer\" title=\"Searing Pincer\">Searing Pincers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Haunt\" title=\"Burning Haunt\">Burning Haunts</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Twins\" title=\"Burning Twins\">Burning Twins</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"NPC.27s_3\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\">NPC's</span></h3>\n<ul><li> <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Wounded_Soldier\" title=\"Wounded Soldier\">Wounded Soldier</a>\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Tainted_Crypt\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Tainted Crypt</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Torture_Chamber_Layout\" title=\"Torture Chamber Layout\">Torture Chamber Layout</a>. Located off Tainted Grove. \n</p><p>Contains: <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Mystic\" title=\"Orok Mystic\">Orok Mystics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warriors</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Mutant Hulk\">Mutant Hulks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Venomspitter\" title=\"Whisker Venomspitter\">Whisker Venomspitters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Broodling\" title=\"Poison Broodling\">Poison Broodlings</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Blademaster\" title=\"Poison Blademaster\">Poison Blademasters</a>. \n</p><p>The Tainted Crypt also contains an exit to to Level 5.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_6\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 6</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ruined_Castle_Layout\" title=\"Ruined Castle Layout\">Ruined Castle Layout</a>.  Contains: <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Spawn\" title=\"Orok Spawn\">Orok Spawn</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Scout\" title=\"Orok Scout\">Orok Scouts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Mystic\" title=\"Orok Mystic\">Orok Mystics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warriors</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Mutant Hulk\">Mutant Hulks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Blademaster\" title=\"Poison Blademaster\">Poison Blademasters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Broodling\" title=\"Poison Broodling\">Poison Broodlings</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Venomspitter\" title=\"Whisker Venomspitter\">Whisker Venomspitters</a>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_7\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 7</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ruined_Castle_Layout\" title=\"Ruined Castle Layout\">Ruined Castle Layout</a>.  Contains: <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Spawn\" title=\"Orok Spawn\">Orok Spawn</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Scout\" title=\"Orok Scout\">Orok Scouts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Mystic\" title=\"Orok Mystic\">Orok Mystics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warriors</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Mutant Hulk\">Mutant Hulks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Blademaster\" title=\"Poison Blademaster\">Fizz Star-Soaked Blademasters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Broodling\" title=\"Poison Broodling\">Fizz Star-Soaked Broodlings</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Venomspitter\" title=\"Whisker Venomspitter\">Whisker Fizzwater Gunners</a>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Porthole_Laboratory\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Porthole Laboratory</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Torture_Chamber_Layout\" title=\"Torture Chamber Layout\">Torture Chamber Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Mutant Hulk\">Mutant Fizzwater Mixers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Puker\" title=\"Mutant Puker\">Mutant Fizzwater Guards</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Twins\" title=\"Burning Twins\">Burning Twins</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Pincer\" title=\"Searing Pincer\">Searing Pincers</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Little_Dew_Valley_Forest\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Little Dew Valley Forest</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Forest_Layout\" title=\"Forest Layout\">Forest Layout</a>. Contains<a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Hulk\" title=\"Mutant Hulk\">Mutant Fizzwater Mixers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Puker\" title=\"Mutant Puker\">Mutant Fizzwater Guards</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Twins\" title=\"Burning Twins\">Burning Twins</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Pincer\" title=\"Searing Pincer\">Searing Pincers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Collector\" title=\"Bone Collector\">Bone Collectors</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Sissirat.27s_Safe_House\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Sissirat's Safe House</span></h2>\n<p>You will encounter a locked door on Level 7.  Only by proceeding to Sissirat's Lair and killing Sissirat can you get the key.  You can then return to Level 7, enter the Safe House, and destroy Ratphonse <a href=\"/wiki/Capwn\" title=\"Capwn\">Capwn</a> to fulfill a <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Quests\" title=\"Category:Quests\">Quest</a>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Sissirat.27s_Lair\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Sissirat's Lair</span></h1>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:152px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Boss-Sissirat.jpg\" title=\"Sissirat, the Boss of Algernon\"><img alt=\"Sissirat, the Boss of Algernon\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"191\" src=\"/images/Boss-Sissirat.jpg\" width=\"150\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Boss-Sissirat.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>Sissirat, the Boss of Algernon</b></div></div></div>\n<p>Located off Algernon level 7. \n</p><p>Contains: <a href=\"/wiki/Sissirat\" title=\"Sissirat\">Sissirat</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rattle_Toe\" title=\"Rattle Toe\">Rattle Toe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Broodling\" title=\"Poison Broodling\">Poison Broodlings</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Venomspitter\" title=\"Whisker Venomspitter\">Whisker Venomspitters</a>.  Killing the Boss (Sissirat) will open the door to the treasure chests and a one way portal to <a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror_Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror Dome\">Algor's Terror Dome</a>.\n</p><p>For tips on fighting Sissirat, see the <a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Guide\" title=\"Boss Guide\">Sissirat Boss Guide</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
